   "level": 3,
   "text": "Spoken as up, sharp, upsharp, etc. Note that up can be respelled as downsharp."
  },
  {
   "heading": "Quarter-tone notation",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "Since a sharp raises by two steps, quarter-tone accidentals can also be used."
  },
  {
   "heading": "Sagittal notation",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "This notation uses the same sagittal sequence as EDOs 52 and 59b ."
